               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:13pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Instructions:<span style="font-size:12pt;text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">You are requesting an exception to the SAP policy. Your appeal must include the following:</p><ol style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><li style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal">SAP Appeal form</li><li style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal">Personal statement that includes:</li><ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha"><li style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal">Description of the circumstances that contributed to your inability to reach satisfactory academic progress</li><li style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal">The steps you have taken to improve your future academic performance.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>(i.e: “I have obtained academic advising, I have also reduced the number of enrolled units to ensure I successfully complete all attempted units.”)</li></ol><li style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal">Documentation of the circumstances described in your statement (e.g., medical records, police report, etc.).</li></ol><ol style="font-size:11pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><ol style="list-style-type:lower-alpha"><li style="font-size:9pt">If you are appealing to request a<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline">SAP Re-Calcuation</span> with additional earned units the documentation requirement is optional. You must still submit this form and a personal statement.</li></ol></ol><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p></body>
               </exData>
            </value>
