            </ui>
            <value>
               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Approved for SAP Re-Calculation:<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">California State University, Fullerton, evaluates SAP after the Spring semester, known as our official evaluation point. Even if you have made SAP on your own<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span>with additional earned units, you are still required to appeal if you are asking our office to re-calculate your SAP before the end of the upcoming Spring semester. If your appeal is approved, we will update your SAP status to met and you will be eligible for financial aid as defined by U.S. Department of Education regulations. After the upcoming Spring semester, we will re-calculate your SAP again.</p></body>
